<p class="post-intro">Over 350 people joined us yesterday for the webinar organised by Innovate UK Business Connect.</p>

<p>I'm sure there are easily ten times more people who are genuinely interested in starting a business in the UK and getting the official business support from the UK Government.</p>

<p>At the webinar, I spoke a bit about how I've been supported since 2017 with Petiole Pro. And now, literally this Friday, I have a meeting with my knowledge transfer partner to talk about intellectual property for <a href="/moomore/">MooMore</a> and some other aspects of the founder's journey 🐮</p>

<p>The main point: whether you're a startup or big enough to think about scaling your business, there's a suite of support that fits your needs.</p>

<p>To name a few, here are the 5 ways Innovate UK Business Connect can support you 👇</p>

<h2><span class="num">1.</span> Sector newsletter</h2>

<p>Free funding calls, insights and events in your inbox. The team really works hard to collect everything relevant, and I read every issue 🙏</p>

{{ photo(photos.iukbcSlideNewsletter, sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px", class="page-figure--portrait") }}

<h2><span class="num">2.</span> Webinars</h2>

<p>Free sessions to learn and connect with people in your niche. The next webinar in the series "Understanding the Innovation Journey" is on 8 December, about mentoring.</p>

{{ photo(photos.iukbcSlideWebinars, sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px", class="page-figure--portrait") }}

<h2><span class="num">3.</span> Events</h2>

<p>Brokerage events, workshops and the annual AgriFood Innovation Showcase (I've attended most of them!)</p>

{{ photo(photos.iukbcSlideEvents, sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px", class="page-figure--portrait") }}

<h2><span class="num">4.</span> Sector experts</h2>

<p>As I mentioned, a company has a Knowledge Transfer Manager who helps to refine your idea and makes warm introductions.</p>

{{ photo(photos.iukbcSlideExperts, sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px", class="page-figure--portrait") }}

<h2><span class="num">5.</span> Support as you grow</h2>

<p>Help is available at each stage. Whether it's investor readiness, IP rights or the search for university partners for a consortium: explain your innovation and ask.</p>

{{ photo(photos.iukbcSlideGrow, sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px", class="page-figure--portrait") }}

